menu "esp-uac2-host Test App"

config UAC2_TEST12_DURATION_SEC
    int "Test 12 duration (seconds)"
    range 0 3600
    default 3600
    help
        Duration for the long-running stability test in the boot harness.
        Set to 0 to skip Test 12 entirely during local smoke runs.

config UAC2_TEST_TONES_SUBWOOFER
    bool "Play test tones in the subwoofer range"
    default n
    help
        The harness plays 1 kHz tones (plus 440/880/750 Hz and 100-900 Hz
        cycles), which a subwoofer's low-pass filter removes. Enable for
        listening checks through a subwoofer: every tone moves to 30-110 Hz
        at -12 dBFS.

config UAC2_TEST_RESTART_SEC
    int "Restart the ESP32 this many seconds into Test 12 (0 = off)"
    range 0 3600
    default 0
    help
        Calls esp_restart() mid-stream, once per power-on (a boot after a
        software restart skips it); listen for the next boot's tones. With
        CONFIG_UAC2_STOP_STREAMS_ON_RESTART the driver stops the stream
        first. Keep it below CONFIG_UAC2_TEST12_DURATION_SEC.

config UAC2_DUPLEX_TEST_SEC
    int "Duplex streaming check duration (seconds)"
    range 5 3600
    default 30
    depends on UAC2_ALLOW_DUPLEX
    help
        How long the duplex live check plays and captures at the same time
        (builds with CONFIG_UAC2_ALLOW_DUPLEX only).

endmenu
